    "title": "2026 Masters Tee Times Thursday: When do players start in first round?",
    "text": "Updated April 9, 2026, 9:31 a.m. ETThe 90th Masters Tournament kicks off Thursday morning with Round 1, and here are the tee times released earlier in the week by Augusta National Golf Club for first-round groupings.Former Masters winners Gary Player, Jack Nicklaus and Tom Watson will be the honorary starters at 7:25 a.m. ET, followed by John Keefer and Haotong Li teeing off at 7:40 a.m.The field will go off in sets of three (with two pairs of two) on the first two days of the tournament. Each group will play a morning round on one day and an afternoon round on the other. Players are in the same group on the first two days.Traditionally, the defending Masters champion plays with the reigning U.S. Amateur champion, and that will be the case again in 2026 for Rory McIlroy and Mason Howell.Here's a look at the full list of tee times, as well as some high-powered groupings patrons and fans online will be watching. All groups go off the No. 1 tee.As the tournament begins Thursday, you can keep up with live updates and scoring all day here.2026 Masters Tee Times for Thursday's Round 1* Amateur participant7:25 a.m. Gary Player, Jack Nicklaus, Tom Watson (honorary starters)7:40 a.m. John Keefer, Haotong Li7:50 a.m. Naoyuki Kataoka, Max Homa, Carlos Ortiz8:02 a.m. Jose Maria Olazabal, Rasmus Neergaard-Petersen, Aldrich Potgieter8:14 a.m. Angel Cabrera, Sami Valimaki, *Jackson Herrington8:26 a.m. Charl Schwartzel, Max Greyserman, Ryan Fox8:38 a.m. Vijay Singh, Matt McCarty, Rasmus Hojgaard8:50 a.m. Kurt Kitayama, Kristoffer Reitan, Casey Jarvis9:02 a.m. Bubba Watson, Nicolas Echavarria, *Brandon Holtz9:19 a.m. Cameron Smith, Sam Burns, Jake Knapp9:31 a.m. Keegan Bradley, Ryan Gerard, Nick Taylor9:43 a.m. Dustin Johnson, Shane Lowry, Jason Day9:55 a.m. Patrick Reed, Tommy Fleetwood, Akshay Bhatia10:07 a.m. Bryson DeChambeau, Matt Fitzpatrick, Xander Schauffele10:19 a.m. Hideki Matsuyama, Collin Morikawa, Russell Henley10:31 a.m. Rory McIlroy, Cameron Young, *Mason Howell10:43 a.m. Viktor Hovland, Patrick Cantlay, Alex Noren11:03 a.m. Samuel Stevens, Sungjae Im11:15 a.m. Andrew Novak, Tom McKibbin, Brian Campbell11:27 a.m. Mike Weir, Wyndham Clark, *Mateo Pulcini11:39 a.m. Zach Johnson, Michael Kim, Nicolai Hojgaard11:51 a.m. Danny Willett, Davis Riley, *Ethan Fang12:03 p.m. Adam Scott, Daniel Berger, Brian Harman12:15 p.m. Fred Couples, Min Woo Lee, *Fifa Laopakdee12:27 p.m. Sergio Garcia, Aaron Rai, Jacob Bridgeman12:44 p.m. Harry Hall, Corey Conners, Michael Brennan12:56 p.m. J9:31 a.m. J.J. Spaun, Maverick McNealy, Tyrrell Hatton1:08 p.m. Jon Rahm, Chris Gotterup, Ludvig Aberg1:20 p.m. Jordan Spieth, Justin Rose, Brooks Koepka1:32 p.m. Sepp Straka, Ben Griffin, Justin Thomas1:44 p.m. Scottie Scheffler, Robert MacIntyre, Gary Woodland1:56 p.m. Harris English, Marco Penge, Si Woo Kim2026 Masters Tournament Featured GroupingsHere are the most-anticipated groups to watch during the first two rounds of the Masters.9:55 a.m. Patrick Reed, Tommy Fleetwood, Akshay Bhatia10:07 a.m. Bryson DeChambeau, Matt Fitzpatrick, Xander Schauffele10:19 a.m. Hideki Matsuyama, Collin Morikawa, Russell Henley1:08 p.m. Jon Rahm, Chris Gotterup, Ludvig Aberg1:20 p.m. Jordan Spieth, Justin Rose, Brooks Koepka1:44 p.m. Scottie Scheffler, Robert MacIntyre, Gary Woodland",
